  47:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * \section IfxLld_Pcie_Architecture_Desc File Description
  48:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  49:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * \subsection IfxLld_Pcie_Architecture_Desc_Rc Rc
  50:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * Pcie/Rc/IfxPcie_Rc.*\n
  51:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * These files contain APIs for configuring and initializing Aurix as RC
  52:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  53:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * \subsection IfxLld_Pcie_Architecture_Desc_Ep Ep
  54:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * Pcie/Ep/IfxPcie_Ep.*\n
  55:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * These files contain APIs for configuring and initializing Aurix as EP
  56:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  57:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * \subsection IfxLld_Pcie_Architecture_Desc_Lib Lib
  58:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * This folder contains file libraries needed for both EP and RC
  59:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  60:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *     - Dma
  61:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       Pcie/Lib/Dma/IfxPcieLib_Dma.*
  62:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       These files contain APIs for configuring, initializing, and using PCIe DMA controller
  63:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  64:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *     - Device
  65:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       Pcie/Lib/Device/IfxPcieLib_Device.*
  66:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       These files contain APIs for using ATU and initializing SRC nodes.
  67:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  68:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *     - Cap
  69:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       Pcie/Lib/Cap/IfxPcieLib_Cap.*
  70:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       These files contain APIs for probing and configuring device capabilities
  71:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  72:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * \subsection IfxLld_Pcie_Architecture_Desc_Std Std
  73:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  * This folder contains standard layer files of PCIe
  74:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  75:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *     - Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.*
  76:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       These files contain low level APIs and data structures common to RC and EP mode
  77:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       Example: enabling link training, setting device mode, enabling/disabling module, etc.
  78:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  79:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *     - Pcie/Std/IfxPcieRc.*
  80:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       These files contain low level APIs and data structures used in RC mode
  81:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       Example: setting number of lanes, writing msi address, enabling interrupts, etc.
  82:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  83:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *     - Pcie/Std/IfxPcieEp.*
  84:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       These files contain low level APIs and data structures used in EP mode
  85:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       Example: setting bar mask, enabling local loopback, checking link state, etc.
  86:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *
  87:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *     - Pcie/Std/IfxPcieDma.*
  88:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Pcie/Std/IfxPcie.h ****  *       These files contain low level APIs and data structures for using DMA
